---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What Network Academy stores about you: nothing unless you choose to make an account.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-neutral mt-6 dark:prose-invert">
      <p>Short version: you can use the whole site without an account, and then it collects no personal information. There is no advertising and there are no analytics. If you choose to create an account, we store your email address and your learning progress so it can follow you between devices.</p>
      <h2>What is stored in your browser</h2>
      <p>The site saves a few small items in your browser's local storage so it can remember you. They never leave your device.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><code>na-theme</code>: light or dark preference.</li>
        <li><code>na-progress</code> and <code>na-last</code>: which lessons you marked complete and the last lesson you opened.</li>
        <li><code>na-bgp-missions</code> and <code>na-trainer-best</code>: your BGP lab missions and subnetting trainer scores.</li>
        <li><code>na-game</code>: your XP, stars and streak from the game and practice rounds.</li>
        <li>If you log in, the login service also keeps a session token in local storage so you stay logged in.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Clear your browser's site data to remove all of it.</p>
      <h2>Accounts (optional)</h2>
      <p>Logging in unlocks the game's later regions, the harder NOC incidents, the daily challenge and badges, and saves your progress to your account. When accounts are switched on, they are provided by <a href="https://supabase.com">Supabase</a>, which stores your email address and a hashed password.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>What we store for you:</strong> your email address and one record of your progress: XP, stars, streak, badges and which lessons you finished. Nothing you type into the calculators or tools is stored.</li>
        <li><strong>Who can see it:</strong> only you can read or change your progress record. The database enforces this with row level security.</li>
        <li><strong>Logging out</strong> clears the progress from that browser so a shared computer is left clean. Your progress stays on your account.</li>
        <li><strong>Deleting your account</strong> is not self-service yet. Until it is, email the address below to request removal.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What you type into the tools</h2>
      <p>The calculators, trainer, BGP lab and config generator run entirely in your browser. Addresses, names and configurations you enter are not sent to any server.</p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>Like any website, the host that serves these pages may keep standard server logs (such as IP address and requested page) for security and operations. We do not have access to a separate analytics or tracking system.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this changes, for example if analytics are added, this page will be updated first.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Network Academy is developed by PKT. Privacy questions or an account deletion request: <a href="mailto:bdilidili1@gmail.com">bdilidili1@gmail.com</a>, or 215 Tres Cruses, Tanza, Cavite, Philippines.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
